        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"29909\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And of course, there are definitely moments when all three of these characters get serious, as others have mentioned above.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There’s a reason “Let’s Get Dangerous” is still the trope name after decades…</p>\n<p>Perhaps the Sentinels version would be “You put me in chains. I will put you in the ground!”</p>",
