        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-01-21T23:36:44.898Z",
        "cooked": "<p>New villain confirmed:  General Problems!</p>\n<p>I’d like to think that young Portja Kir-Pro, a totally normal purple Thorathian girl growing up under the benevolent protection of an Authority Ziggurat probably not yet under the command of Rainek Kel-Voss (he’s probably like a Sergeant at this point in time), has to admit to people who casually get to know her “yes, I do have a second power, it’s just dumb and useless, but I totally do have it and I’ll prove it if you insist.  I’m totally not one of those, er um, defective powered Thorathians with only one power, perish the thought.  I hate those people too just like you, just like everyone else does and should.” <em>shifty eyes</em></p>\n<p>Excuse me, Checmistry is what comes from Pike Industries.</p>\n<p>A Ted Doggett letter!  Not my best work, and less than satisfyingly answered (Dawn a monster? Pfah!), but the first time since way back that I get to discover a letter of mine being answered.</p>\n<p>Argh, I definitely had at least two additional comments, but now that my brain chemistry is no longer being maintained at single digit Kelvins by the Minnesota weather, I’m no longer superconductive enough to remember them.  I was really looking forward to adding three paragraphs of text with just a single edit, but instead the other two points will have to be recreated later.</p>",
